msgid "\"%1$s\" has a contrast ratio of %2$s against its background; %3$s is the readable minimum."
msgstr "「%1$s」與背景的對比只有 %2$s，可讀的最低標準是 %3$s。"

msgid "\"%s\" cannot be placed inside a box."
msgstr "「%s」不能放在 box 裡面。"

msgid "\"%s\" is not a valid action type."
msgstr "「%s」不是有效的 action 類型。"

msgid "%1$d LINE notification sent for status: %2$s"
msgstr "狀態 %2$s 已送出 %1$d 則 LINE 通知"

msgid "%1$d of %2$d chosen"
msgstr "已選 %1$d／%2$d"

msgid "%1$s (was %2$s)"
msgstr "%1$s（原價 %2$s）"

msgid "%1$s cannot be \"%2$s\". Allowed: %3$s."
msgstr "%1$s 不能是「%2$s」。可用值：%3$s。"

msgid "%1$s of %2$s characters"
msgstr "已用 %1$s／%2$s 字"

msgid "%1$s of %2$s entries"
msgstr "%2$s 筆中的 %1$s 筆"

msgid "%1$s of %2$s push messages used."
msgstr "已使用 %1$s／%2$s 則推播訊息。"

msgid "%1$s to %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s 至 %2$s"

msgid "%1$s: %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s：%2$s"

msgid "%d area(s) have no destination set yet."
msgstr "有 %d 個區塊還沒設定點擊後要做什麼。"

msgid "%d cards. The customer swipes sideways to reach the rest."
msgstr "共 %d 張卡片，客人要左右滑動才看得到其他張。"

msgid "%d condition"
msgstr "%d 個條件"

msgid "%s push messages sent this month. This plan has no monthly cap."
msgstr "本月已送出 %s 則推播訊息。這個方案沒有月上限。"

msgid "(Check the channel plan and that the feature is enabled for this channel.)"
msgstr "（請確認頻道方案，以及這個功能是否已為該頻道開啟。）"

msgid "(no fallback text -- the notification would be blank)"
msgstr "（沒有備援文字，通知會是空白的）"

msgid "(no question yet)"
msgstr "（還沒填問題）"

msgid "+ Add a button"
msgstr "+ 新增按鈕"

msgid "+ Add a card"
msgstr "+ 新增卡片"

msgid "+ Add a question"
msgstr "+ 新增問題"

msgid "-- choose --"
msgstr "-- 請選擇 --"

msgid "A %1$s action needs %2$s."
msgstr "%1$s action 必須有 %2$s。"

msgid "A %s component needs a url."
msgstr "%s 元件必須有 url。"

msgid "A Flex Message bubble or carousel, as JSON. Values in braces are replaced with the order's details before sending."
msgstr "Flex 訊息的 bubble 或 carousel，以 JSON 表示。大括號裡的變數會在送出前換成該筆訂單的資料。"

msgid "A Flex message needs a contents container."
msgstr "Flex 訊息必須有 contents 容器。"

msgid "A Flex message needs altText (shown in the chat list and push notification)."
msgstr "Flex 訊息必須有 altText（顯示在聊天列表和推播通知上）。"

msgid "A Flex template"
msgstr "Flex 範本"

msgid "A LINE user id, which you can copy from the LINE users screen. Push messages are billed."
msgstr "LINE 使用者 ID，可以從「LINE 使用者」頁面複製。推播訊息會計費。"

msgid "A LINE user id. Leave blank to just get a link you can share yourself."
msgstr "LINE 使用者 ID。留空就只會產生連結，由你自己分享。"

msgid "A bubble needs at least one of header, hero, body or footer."
msgstr "bubble 至少要有 header、hero、body 或 footer 其中之一。"

msgid "A button needs an action."
msgstr "button 必須有 action。"

msgid "A button on card %d has no label."
msgstr "第 %d 張卡片上有按鈕沒有文字。"

msgid "A buttons template holds at most %d buttons."
msgstr "按鈕型範本最多 %d 個按鈕。"

msgid "A buttons template needs some text."
msgstr "按鈕型範本需要填入文字。"

msgid "A carousel holds at most %d bubbles."
msgstr "一組輪播最多 %d 個 bubble。"

msgid "A carousel holds at most %d cards."
msgstr "一組輪播最多 %d 張卡片。"

msgid "A carousel holds at most 10 cards."
msgstr "一組輪播最多 10 張卡片。"

msgid "A carousel holds at most 12 cards."
msgstr "一組輪播最多 12 張卡片。"

msgid "A carousel needs at least one bubble in contents."
msgstr "輪播的 contents 至少要有一個 bubble。"

msgid "A carousel needs at least one card."
msgstr "輪播至少要有一張卡片。"

msgid "A colour matching the status"
msgstr "對應該狀態的顏色"

msgid "A component at %s is missing its type."
msgstr "%s 的元件缺少 type。"

msgid "A confirm template must have exactly two buttons -- LINE refuses one or three."
msgstr "確認型範本必須剛好兩個按鈕——一個或三個 LINE 都會拒絕。"

msgid "A confirm template needs a question."
msgstr "確認型範本需要填入問題。"

msgid "A date"
msgstr "日期"

msgid "A flow asks a series of questions and stores the answers. Only one flow runs per person at a time, it expires after 30 minutes of silence, and every question offers a way to cancel."
msgstr "流程會依序問一串問題並記下答案。每個人同時只會進行一個流程，超過 30 分鐘沒有回應就會結束，而且每一題都提供取消的方式。"

msgid "A flow needs at least one step."
msgstr "流程至少要有一個步驟。"

msgid "A member of our team will reply here shortly."
msgstr "我們的同事很快會在這裡回覆您。"

msgid "A number"
msgstr "數字"

msgid "A payment for this order id already exists."
msgstr "這個訂單 ID 已經有一筆付款了。"

msgid "A phone number"
msgstr "電話號碼"

msgid "A phone number we can reach you on?"
msgstr "方便聯絡的電話號碼是？"

msgid "A question with exactly two answers"
msgstr "一個問題，剛好兩個答案"

msgid "A quick reply set"
msgstr "快速回覆組合"

msgid "A sentence or two about what this is."
msgstr "用一兩句話說明這是什麼。"

msgid "A sticker"
msgstr "貼圖"

msgid "A template needs at least one card."
msgstr "範本至少要有一張卡片。"

msgid "A text component needs either text or a contents array of spans."
msgstr "text 元件必須有 text，或是一個由 span 組成的 contents 陣列。"

msgid "A transaction id or order id is required."
msgstr "必須提供交易 ID 或訂單 ID。"

msgid "A uri action must point at https://, tel: or a LINE URL scheme."
msgstr "uri action 必須指向 https://、tel: 或 LINE 的 URL scheme。"

msgid "A visitor completed \"%s\" on LINE."
msgstr "有訪客在 LINE 上完成了「%s」。"

msgid "AI Engine (Meow Apps)"
msgstr "AI Engine（Meow Apps）"

msgid "AI Engine has no AI service with an API key yet. Add one under Meow Apps > AI Engine > Settings."
msgstr "AI Engine 還沒有任何帶 API 金鑰的 AI 服務。請到 Meow Apps > AI Engine > Settings 新增一組。"

msgid "AI Engine is active but has no AI service with an API key, so it cannot answer anything yet. Add one under Meow Apps > AI Engine > Settings."
msgstr "AI Engine 已啟用，但還沒有任何帶 API 金鑰的 AI 服務，所以它目前一句話也答不出來。請到 Meow Apps > AI Engine > Settings 新增一組。"

msgid "AI Engine is not active"
msgstr "AI Engine 沒有啟用"

msgid "AI Engine is not active on this site."
msgstr "這個站台沒有啟用 AI Engine。"

msgid "AI features are switched off for this site."
msgstr "這個站台已關閉 AI 功能。"

msgid "AI provider available"
msgstr "AI 服務可用"

msgid "AI replies"
msgstr "AI 回覆"

msgid "AI replies are switched on but no AI service is selected."
msgstr "AI 回覆已開啟，但還沒有選擇要用哪個 AI 服務。"

msgid "AI replies are switched on, but the selected AI service is not available on this site."
msgstr "AI 回覆已開啟，但所選的 AI 服務在這個站台上並不存在。"

msgid "AI service"
msgstr "AI 服務"

msgid "About %s messages remain in this month allowance."
msgstr "本月額度大約還剩 %s 則訊息。"

msgid "Access token"
msgstr "Access Token"

msgid "Action labels are limited to 20 characters."
msgstr "Action 的 label 上限為 20 字。"

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Active"
msgstr "啟用"

msgid "Active templates"
msgstr "啟用中的範本"

msgid "Add a LINE tab where customers can link and unlink their account"
msgstr "新增一個 LINE 分頁，讓客人可以連結或解除連結帳號"

msgid "Add a notification template"
msgstr "新增通知範本"

msgid "Add at least one button."
msgstr "請至少加入一個按鈕。"

msgid "Add at least one quick reply button."
msgstr "請至少加入一個快速回覆按鈕。"

msgid "Add condition"
msgstr "新增條件"

msgid "Add or edit a rule"
msgstr "新增或編輯規則"

msgid "Add order notification"
msgstr "新增訂單通知"

msgid "Add the Channel ID and Channel Secret from the LINE Developers Console."
msgstr "請從 LINE Developers Console 填入 Channel ID 與 Channel Secret。"

msgid "Add the LINE Pay Channel ID and Channel Secret."
msgstr "請填入 LINE Pay 的 Channel ID 與 Channel Secret。"

msgid "Add us on LINE"
msgstr "加入 LINE 好友"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "進階"

msgid "Agent"
msgstr "客服"

msgid "Alias"
msgstr "別名"

msgid "Alias ID"
msgstr "別名 ID"

msgid "All areas"
msgstr "所有區塊"

msgid "All conversations"
msgstr "所有對話"

msgid "All results"
msgstr "所有結果"

msgid "All the customer sees until they open the chat. This is the fallback text, not the bubble."
msgstr "客人點開聊天室之前只會看到這些。這是備援文字，不是卡片。"

msgid "Already shopped with us?"
msgstr "已經是我們的顧客了嗎？"

msgid "Amount"
msgstr "金額"

msgid "An email address"
msgstr "Email 地址"

msgid "An icon component needs a url."
msgstr "icon 元件必須有 url。"

msgid "An image"
msgstr "圖片"

msgid "An image carousel holds at most %d images."
msgstr "圖片輪播最多 %d 張圖片。"

msgid "An image carousel needs at least one image."
msgstr "圖片輪播至少要有一張圖片。"

msgid "Answer"
msgstr "答案類型"

msgid "Answer in the language the customer used. Keep it short: this is a chat message, not an article."
msgstr "請使用客人所用的語言回答。回覆要簡短：這是聊天訊息，不是文章。"

msgid "Answers"
msgstr "答案"

msgid "Answers longer than this are truncated. LINE hard-limits a text message at 5000 characters."
msgstr "超過這個長度的答案會被截斷。LINE 對文字訊息的硬上限是 5000 字。"

msgid "Any order"
msgstr "所有訂單"

msgid "Anything (catch-all)"
msgstr "任何訊息（萬用）"

msgid "Anything they type"
msgstr "客人輸入的任何內容"

msgid "Area"
msgstr "區塊"

msgid "Areas %s overlap. LINE uses whichever comes first, which is rarely what you want."
msgstr "區塊 %s 互相重疊。LINE 會採用排在前面的那一個，這通常不是你要的結果。"

msgid "Arrow keys nudge by 1 pixel, with Shift by 10."
msgstr "方向鍵每次移動 1 像素，按住 Shift 為 10 像素。"

msgid "Asked one at a time, in this order. Each answer is stored under its own key, which is the column you see in submissions."
msgstr "依這個順序一題一題問。每個答案會存在自己的欄位名稱下，也就是你在回覆記錄裡看到的欄位。"

msgid "At least 1040 pixels wide. Five copies are cut on save, because LINE asks for the image at five widths and refuses a URL with a file extension."
msgstr "寬度至少 1040 像素。儲存時會切出五份，因為 LINE 會用五種寬度來要圖，而且拒絕帶副檔名的網址。"

msgid "At most 14 characters, shown at the bottom of the chat."
msgstr "最多 14 字，顯示在聊天室下方。"

msgid "Attach a Flex template"
msgstr "附加 Flex 範本"

msgid "Auto replies"
msgstr "自動回覆"

msgid "Available values"
msgstr "可用的變數"

msgid "Back to a single card"
msgstr "改回單張卡片"

msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景色"

msgid "Banner image"
msgstr "橫幅圖片"

msgid "Billing address"
msgstr "帳單地址"

msgid "Billing name"
msgstr "帳單姓名"

msgid "Billing phone"
msgstr "帳單電話"

msgid "Blank"
msgstr "空白"

msgid "Bot"
msgstr "機器人"

msgid "Broadcast"
msgstr "群發訊息"

msgid "Broadcast sent to every friend of the account."
msgstr "已群發給帳號的所有好友。"

msgid "Broadcasts are billed per recipient and cannot be recalled. Send a test to yourself first."
msgstr "群發訊息按人數計費，而且送出後無法收回。請先發一則測試給自己。"

msgid "Brown & Cony"
msgstr "熊大 & 兔兔"

msgid "Brown & Cony, second set"
msgstr "熊大 & 兔兔（第二彈）"

msgid "Bubble %1$d: %2$s"
msgstr "第 %1$d 個 bubble：%2$s"

msgid "Bubble or carousel JSON"
msgstr "Bubble 或 carousel 的 JSON"

msgid "Build from products"
msgstr "從商品建立"

msgid "Built-in card"
msgstr "內建卡片"

msgid "Button"
msgstr "按鈕"

msgid "Button \"%1$s\" on question %2$d is longer than the %3$d characters LINE shows, and is cut."
msgstr "第 %2$d 題的按鈕「%1$s」超過 LINE 顯示的 %3$d 字，會被截斷。"

msgid "Button label"
msgstr "按鈕文字"

msgid "Button link"
msgstr "按鈕連結"

msgid "Button text"
msgstr "按鈕文字"

msgid "Buttons per card"
msgstr "每張卡片的按鈕數"

msgid "Buttons, one per line"
msgstr "按鈕選項，一行一個"

msgid "Buy now"
msgstr "立即購買"

msgid "Callback URL"
msgstr "Callback URL"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Capture immediately"
msgstr "立即請款"

msgid "Card %1$d has more than the %2$d buttons a carousel card allows."
msgstr "第 %1$d 張卡片超過輪播卡片允許的 %2$d 個按鈕。"

msgid "Card %1$d has more than the %2$d characters LINE allows here."
msgstr "第 %1$d 張卡片超過這裡允許的 %2$d 字。"

msgid "Card %d"
msgstr "卡片 %d"

msgid "Card %d has no buttons."
msgstr "第 %d 張卡片沒有按鈕。"

msgid "Card %d has no text."
msgstr "第 %d 張卡片沒有文字。"

msgid "Cards"
msgstr "卡片"

msgid "Cards have a title"
msgstr "卡片有標題"

msgid "Cards have an image"
msgstr "卡片有圖片"

msgid "Channel ID"
msgstr "Channel ID"

msgid "Channel secret"
msgstr "Channel Secret"

msgid "Chat LIFF ID"
msgstr "聊天用 LIFF ID"

msgid "Chat bar label"
msgstr "聊天列文字"

msgid "Chat list and lock screen"
msgstr "聊天列表與鎖定畫面"

msgid "Chatbot"
msgstr "聊天機器人"

msgid "Chatbot ID"
msgstr "聊天機器人 ID"

msgid "Check"
msgstr "檢查"

msgid "Choose a banner image to start drawing regions."
msgstr "請先選擇橫幅圖片才能開始畫範圍。"

msgid "Choose a conversation"
msgstr "選擇一則對話"

msgid "Choose a menu image first. LINE requires one, 2500px wide and either 1686px or 843px tall."
msgstr "請先選擇選單圖片。LINE 規定必須是寬 2500px、高 1686px 或 843px。"

msgid "Choose a menu image to start drawing areas."
msgstr "請先選擇選單圖片才能開始畫區塊。"

msgid "Choose at least one product."
msgstr "請至少選擇一項商品。"

msgid "Choose image"
msgstr "選擇圖片"

msgid "Choose the banner image first."
msgstr "請先選擇橫幅圖片。"

msgid "Choose what kind of template this is."
msgstr "請選擇這個範本的類型。"

msgid "Clear"
msgstr "清除"

msgid "Clear the log"
msgstr "清除紀錄"

msgid "Cleared %s entries."
msgstr "已清除 %s 筆項目。"

msgid "Click to copy."
msgstr "點一下複製。"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "結束對話"

msgid "Closed"
msgstr "已結束"

msgid "Compare with LINE"
msgstr "與 LINE 比對"

msgid "Conditions"
msgstr "條件"

msgid "Connecting to LINE..."
msgstr "正在連線到 LINE…"

msgid "Consultation"
msgstr "諮詢"

msgid "Context"
msgstr "情境資料"

msgid "Continue with LINE"
msgstr "用 LINE 繼續"

msgid "Conversation flows"
msgstr "對話流程"

msgid "Conversations waiting"
msgstr "等待處理的對話"

msgid "Copied"
msgstr "已複製"

msgid "Corner radius"
msgstr "圓角半徑"

msgid "Could not copy -- select it and copy by hand"
msgstr "無法複製，請自行選取後複製"

msgid "Could not create the folder for the imagemap images."
msgstr "無法建立存放圖片訊息圖檔的資料夾。"

msgid "Could not download the message content (HTTP %d)."
msgstr "無法下載訊息內容（HTTP %d）。"

msgid "Could not reach LINE Pay. Please try again."
msgstr "無法連上 LINE Pay，請再試一次。"

msgid "Could not reach LINE to complete the login. Please try again."
msgstr "無法連上 LINE 完成登入，請再試一次。"

msgid "Could not reach LINE to verify the login. Please try again."
msgstr "無法連上 LINE 驗證登入，請再試一次。"

msgid "Could not reach LINE to verify this session."
msgstr "無法連上 LINE 驗證這次的連線。"

msgid "Could not read the image dimensions."
msgstr "無法讀取圖片尺寸。"

msgid "Create a WordPress account the first time someone logs in with LINE"
msgstr "第一次用 LINE 登入時，自動建立 WordPress 帳號"

msgid "Create a payment link"
msgstr "建立收款連結"

msgid "Create link"
msgstr "建立連結"

msgid "Created"
msgstr "建立時間"

msgid "Credentials"
msgstr "憑證"

msgid "Credentials are encrypted at rest"
msgstr "憑證已加密儲存"

msgid "Currency"
msgstr "幣別"

msgid "Customer email"
msgstr "客人 Email"

msgid "Customer name"
msgstr "客人姓名"

msgid "Customer note"
msgstr "客人備註"

msgid "Daily reply limit"
msgstr "每日回覆上限"

msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr "總覽"

msgid "Date the order was placed"
msgstr "訂單成立日期"

msgid "Days. Older rows are deleted daily."
msgstr "天。更舊的資料每天會被刪除。"

msgid "Days. Set to 0 to keep it indefinitely."
msgstr "天。填 0 代表永久保留。"

msgid "Days. Set to 0 to keep messages forever."
msgstr "天。填 0 代表永久保留訊息。"

msgid "Debug only"
msgstr "只看除錯"

msgid "Default LIFF ID"
msgstr "預設 LIFF ID"

msgid "Default chatbot"
msgstr "預設聊天機器人"

msgid "Default destination"
msgstr "預設導向"

msgid "Delay before sending"
msgstr "送出前延遲"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "刪除"

msgid "Delete every entry in the plugin log? The log is only used for diagnosis, so nothing else is lost."
msgstr "要刪除紀錄裡的所有項目嗎？紀錄只用於排查問題，刪掉不會影響其他資料。"

msgid "Delete this area"
msgstr "刪除這個區塊"

msgid "Delete this permanently?"
msgstr "要永久刪除嗎？"

msgid "Delivered"
msgstr "已送達"

msgid "Delivered in the last 30 days"
msgstr "近 30 天已送達"

msgid "Delivered to %1$d, failed for %2$d. %3$s"
msgstr "成功 %1$d 筆，失敗 %2$d 筆。%3$s"

msgid "Description"
msgstr "說明"

msgid "Detail"
msgstr "詳細"

msgid "Discount"
msgstr "折扣"

msgid "Display name"
msgstr "顯示名稱"

msgid "Do not invite"
msgstr "不邀請"

msgid "Drag on the image to add an area, or click one to edit it."
msgstr "在圖片上拖曳可新增區塊，點選既有區塊可編輯。"

msgid "Drag on the image to draw a region. Click one to move, resize or set what it does. Coordinates are in the 1040-wide space LINE renders in."
msgstr "在圖上拖曳畫出範圍。點選既有範圍可以移動、調整大小或設定它的動作。座標是以 LINE 實際算圖的 1040 寬度為基準。"

msgid "Drag on the image to draw an area. Click one to move, resize or set what it does. Edges snap to each other, because a one-pixel gap is invisible here and dead to the customer."
msgstr "在圖片上拖曳來畫出區塊。點選區塊可以移動、調整大小或設定它的動作。邊緣會互相吸附，因為一像素的縫隙在這裡看不出來，對客人來說卻是點不到的死角。"

msgid "Drawn as the customer receives it, on a phone-width screen. A push cannot be recalled, so this and \"Send test\" are the only checks you get."
msgstr "以客人收到的樣子、在手機寬度的畫面上呈現。推播送出後無法收回，所以這裡和「發送測試」是你僅有的兩道確認。"

msgid "Drawn as the customer receives it. The exact fonts and corners are LINE's, not this preview's."
msgstr "以客人收到的樣子呈現。實際的字體和圓角以 LINE 為準，不是這個預覽。"

msgid "Duplicate"
