msgid "The AI service is present but has no provider connected yet, so it cannot answer anything."
msgstr "AI 服務在，但還沒有接上任何供應商，所以目前什麼都答不出來。"

msgid "The Channel ID, Channel Secret and sandbox switch live on the <a href=\"%s\">LINE Pay settings screen</a>, so they are stored encrypted and shared with payment links."
msgstr "Channel ID、Channel Secret 與沙盒開關都在 <a href=\"%s\">LINE Pay 設定頁</a>，會加密儲存，並與收款連結共用。"

msgid "The WordPress AI Client is part of WordPress itself from version 7.0, so nothing needs installing to use it. It still needs a provider connected before it can answer."
msgstr "WordPress AI Client 從 7.0 起就是 WordPress 本身的一部分，不必另外安裝任何東西。但它仍然要先接上一個供應商才能回答。"

msgid "The account to link to no longer exists."
msgstr "要連結的帳號已經不存在了。"

msgid "The amount is not valid for this currency."
msgstr "這個金額不符合該幣別的規則。"

msgid "The bot cannot send or receive anything until this is set."
msgstr "沒有設定這個，機器人無法收發任何訊息。"

msgid "The bot id from AI Engine."
msgstr "AI Engine 裡的 bot id。"

msgid "The box at %s needs a contents array."
msgstr "%s 的 box 必須有 contents 陣列。"

msgid "The box at %s needs a layout."
msgstr "%s 的 box 必須設定 layout。"

msgid "The button \"%1$s\" is longer than the %2$d characters LINE shows."
msgstr "按鈕「%1$s」超過 LINE 顯示的 %2$d 字。"

msgid "The button \"%s\" is a postback but carries no data."
msgstr "按鈕「%s」是 postback，卻沒有帶資料。"

msgid "The button \"%s\" opens a link but has none."
msgstr "按鈕「%s」設定為開啟連結，卻沒有填連結。"

msgid "The button \"%s\" sends a message but has no text."
msgstr "按鈕「%s」設定為送出訊息，卻沒有填內容。"

msgid "The chat bar text is drawn by LINE below the menu, not on your image. This preview shows layout only, not exact fonts or corners."
msgstr "聊天列文字是 LINE 畫在選單下方的，不在你的圖片上。這個預覽只呈現版面，字體和圓角不會完全一樣。"

msgid "The customer cancelled the LINE Pay payment."
msgstr "客人取消了這筆 LINE Pay 付款。"

msgid "The customer has insufficient balance."
msgstr "客人的餘額不足。"

msgid "The customer has not completed authentication."
msgstr "客人尚未完成驗證。"

msgid "The customer is called %s."
msgstr "這位客人的稱呼是 %s。"

msgid "The customer is messaged when the order enters any of these statuses. Each notification is billed as a push message."
msgstr "訂單進入這些狀態的任何一個時，就會發訊息給客人。每則通知都會以推播訊息計費。"

msgid "The customer sends the trigger, the bot answers. Placeholders are filled in with sample values so you can see the sentence they actually read."
msgstr "客人送出觸發文字，機器人回覆。變數會帶入範例值，讓你看到客人實際讀到的句子。"

msgid "The filler component was removed by LINE. Use a box with margin, padding or offset instead."
msgstr "filler 元件已被 LINE 移除，請改用帶有 margin、padding 或 offset 的 box。"

msgid "The flow definition is not valid JSON."
msgstr "流程定義不是有效的 JSON。"

msgid "The image is larger than 1 MB, which LINE will reject."
msgstr "圖片超過 1 MB，LINE 會拒絕。"

msgid "The image is only %d pixels wide. An imagemap needs at least 1040, because LINE renders it at that width."
msgstr "這張圖只有 %d 像素寬。圖片訊息至少需要 1040，因為 LINE 就是以那個寬度算圖的。"

msgid "The image must be served over HTTPS. LINE refuses the whole message otherwise, not just the picture."
msgstr "圖片必須以 HTTPS 提供。否則 LINE 會拒收整則訊息，不只是那張圖。"

msgid "The image on card %d must be served over HTTPS."
msgstr "第 %d 張卡片的圖片必須以 HTTPS 提供。"

msgid "The image sizes for this imagemap are missing. Choose the image again and save."
msgstr "這則圖片訊息的圖檔不見了。請重新選擇圖片並儲存。"

msgid "The imagemap could not be saved."
msgstr "圖片訊息儲存失敗。"

msgid "The inbox is switched off under LINE > Settings > Messaging API."
msgstr "收件匣在 LINE > 設定 > Messaging API 裡被關閉了。"

msgid "The link on \"%s\" must start with https://, tel: or a LINE URL."
msgstr "「%s」的連結必須以 https://、tel: 或 LINE 的網址開頭。"

msgid "The link was created, but LINE would not deliver it: %s"
msgstr "連結已建立，但 LINE 沒有把它送出：%s"

msgid "The login response came from an unexpected issuer."
msgstr "登入回應來自非預期的簽發者。"

msgid "The login response did not identify a user."
msgstr "登入回應中沒有識別到使用者。"

msgid "The login response did not match this login attempt."
msgstr "登入回應與這次的登入請求不符。"

msgid "The login response has expired. Please try again."
msgstr "登入回應已過期，請再試一次。"

msgid "The login response was issued for a different channel."
msgstr "登入回應是簽發給另一個頻道的。"

msgid "The message contains this"
msgstr "訊息包含這段文字"

msgid "The message is not valid JSON, so this notification will not send: %s"
msgstr "訊息不是有效的 JSON，這則通知不會送出：%s"

msgid "The message matches this pattern"
msgstr "訊息符合這個比對式"

msgid "The message starts with this"
msgstr "訊息以這段文字開頭"

msgid "The payment account status does not allow this operation."
msgstr "付款帳戶目前的狀態不允許這項操作。"

msgid "The payment could not be recorded."
msgstr "這筆付款無法記錄。"

msgid "The payment could not be started. Please try again."
msgstr "無法開始付款流程，請再試一次。"

msgid "The payment request could not be encoded."
msgstr "付款請求無法編碼。"

msgid "The payment was cancelled."
msgstr "付款已取消。"

msgid "The preview is an approximation. Use \"Check\" to validate against LINE itself, and \"Send test\" to see the real thing in a chat."
msgstr "預覽只是近似的樣子。用「檢查」交給 LINE 驗證，用「發送測試」在聊天室裡看真正的效果。"

msgid "The question"
msgstr "問題內容"

msgid "The question is limited to %d characters."
msgstr "問題上限為 %d 字。"

msgid "The questions as JSON"
msgstr "問題的 JSON"

msgid "The recorded list only includes people this site has seen since the webhook was switched on, so it is usually smaller than the real follower count."
msgstr "本站記錄的名單只包含 Webhook 開啟之後出現過的人，所以通常會比實際好友數少。"

msgid "The request headers were not accepted. Check the Channel Secret."
msgstr "請求標頭未被接受，請檢查 Channel Secret。"

msgid "The rich menu could not be saved."
msgstr "圖文選單儲存失敗。"

msgid "The selected image could not be read from disk."
msgstr "無法從磁碟讀取所選的圖片。"

msgid "The selected image could not be read from the media library."
msgstr "無法從媒體庫讀取所選的圖片。"

msgid "The statuses above use a built-in card. For full control -- your own Flex design, and conditions such as payment or shipping method -- create <a href=\"%s\">notification templates</a>. When a template matches, it replaces the built-in card."
msgstr "上面的狀態使用內建卡片。若要完全掌控（自己的 Flex 設計，以及付款或配送方式之類的條件），請建立<a href=\"%s\">通知範本</a>。範本符合條件時，會取代內建卡片。"

msgid "The tappable areas could not be read."
msgstr "無法讀取可點擊區塊的設定。"

msgid "The template could not be saved."
msgstr "範本儲存失敗。"

msgid "The text is limited to %d characters."
msgstr "文字上限為 %d 字。"

msgid "The title is limited to %d characters."
msgstr "標題上限為 %d 字。"

msgid "The title on card %1$d is longer than %2$d characters."
msgstr "第 %1$d 張卡片的標題超過 %2$d 字。"

msgid "The whole conversation, from the trigger to the last answer. Buttons are drawn where LINE puts them, under the message."
msgstr "從觸發到最後一個答案的完整對話。按鈕畫在 LINE 實際擺放的位置，也就是訊息下方。"

msgid "The whole message is exactly this"
msgstr "整則訊息剛好等於這段文字"

msgid "Their answer"
msgstr "客人的回答"

msgid "There are no orders yet to build a preview from."
msgstr "還沒有訂單可以用來產生預覽。"

msgid "There is nothing to send."
msgstr "沒有可以送出的內容。"

msgid "These apply to every card. LINE refuses a carousel whose cards are not built the same way."
msgstr "這幾項套用到每一張卡片。LINE 會拒絕卡片結構不一致的輪播。"

msgid "These cover the common card. Anything else -- extra rows, colours, more buttons -- is edited in the JSON."
msgstr "這幾欄涵蓋最常見的卡片。其他的（多幾列、顏色、更多按鈕）請在 JSON 裡編輯。"

msgid "This LINE account is already linked to another user on this site."
msgstr "這個 LINE 帳號已經連結到本站的另一位使用者。"

msgid "This WordPress does not have the AI Client. It ships with WordPress 7.0 and later."
msgstr "這個 WordPress 沒有 AI Client。它從 WordPress 7.0 起才內建。"

msgid "This WordPress has no AI Client"
msgstr "這個 WordPress 沒有 AI Client"

msgid "This bubble exceeds the 30 KB limit."
msgstr "這個 bubble 超過 30 KB 上限。"

msgid "This card has a layout these fields cannot describe, so it is edited as JSON below. Nothing here will change it."
msgstr "這張卡片的版面不是這幾個欄位能描述的，請用下方的 JSON 編輯。這裡的欄位不會更動它。"

msgid "This carousel exceeds the 50 KB limit. Remove bubbles or shorten the content."
msgstr "這組輪播超過 50 KB 上限，請減少 bubble 或縮短內容。"

msgid "This does not look like a channel ID: %s. A LINE channel ID is a number, usually ten digits. If your browser filled this in for you, clear it and paste the value from the LINE Developers Console."
msgstr "這看起來不像 Channel ID：%s。LINE 的 Channel ID 是數字，通常十位數。如果是瀏覽器自動填入的，請清空後從 LINE Developers Console 貼上正確的值。"

msgid "This imagemap has no tappable areas yet."
msgstr "這則圖片訊息還沒有設定任何可點擊範圍。"

msgid "This layout nests too deeply."
msgstr "這個版面巢狀層數過深。"

msgid "This link expired. Please go back and try again."
msgstr "這個連結已過期，請返回後再試一次。"

msgid "This login could not be verified. Please try again."
msgstr "這次登入無法通過驗證，請再試一次。"

msgid "This login link has expired. Please try again."
msgstr "這個登入連結已過期，請再試一次。"

msgid "This login request is missing its state. Please start again."
msgstr "這次的登入請求缺少 state，請重新開始。"

msgid "This menu is now the default for everyone."
msgstr "這個選單現在是所有人的預設選單。"

msgid "This merchant cannot use LINE Pay right now. Contact LINE Pay support."
msgstr "這個商店目前無法使用 LINE Pay，請聯絡 LINE Pay 客服。"

msgid "This merchant is not registered with LINE Pay. Check the Channel ID and whether you are pointed at sandbox or production."
msgstr "這個商店代號沒有在 LINE Pay 註冊。請檢查 Channel ID，以及目前是指向沙盒還是正式環境。"

msgid "This message is not a card or a carousel, so it can only be edited as JSON."
msgstr "這則訊息不是卡片也不是輪播，只能用 JSON 編輯。"

msgid "This order has no LINE Pay transaction to refund."
msgstr "這張訂單沒有可退款的 LINE Pay 交易。"

msgid "This order has nothing to pay."
msgstr "這張訂單沒有需要付款的金額。"

msgid "This page could not identify you. Reopen it from LINE."
msgstr "這個頁面無法辨識你的身分，請從 LINE 重新開啟。"

msgid "This payment has already been captured."
msgstr "這筆付款已經請款完成。"

msgid "This payment has already been refunded, or the refund window has closed."
msgstr "這筆付款已經退款，或是已超過可退款期限。"

msgid "This payment is already being confirmed. Please wait a moment and refresh."
msgstr "這筆付款正在確認中，請稍候後重新整理。"

msgid "This payment is already being processed."
msgstr "這筆付款正在處理中。"

msgid "This rich menu has no tappable areas yet."
msgstr "這個圖文選單還沒有設定任何可點擊區塊。"

msgid "This screen is missing."
msgstr "找不到這個畫面。"

msgid "This session belongs to a different channel."
msgstr "這次的連線屬於另一個頻道。"

msgid "This session could not be verified. Reopen the page from LINE."
msgstr "這次的連線無法驗證，請從 LINE 重新開啟頁面。"

msgid "This site is not accepting new registrations through LINE. Please sign in with your existing account first, then link LINE from your profile."
msgstr "這個站台沒有開放用 LINE 註冊新帳號。請先用既有帳號登入，再從個人資料頁連結 LINE。"

msgid "This site is served over plain HTTP. LINE only fetches imagemap images over HTTPS, so an imagemap from this site would arrive blank."
msgstr "這個站台是用純 HTTP 提供的。LINE 只會用 HTTPS 抓取圖片訊息的圖，所以從這個站台送出的圖片訊息會是一片空白。"

msgid "This template did not produce a valid message. Check the JSON and the placeholders."
msgstr "這個範本沒有產生有效的訊息，請檢查 JSON 和變數。"

msgid "This template will not send as it stands."
msgstr "這個範本目前的狀態無法送出。"

msgid "Time"
msgstr "時間"

msgid "Title"
msgstr "標題"

msgid "To build tabs, give several menus the same tab group and point their tab buttons at each other with a \"switch tab\" action."
msgstr "要做分頁，把幾個選單設成同一個分頁群組，再用「切換分頁」動作讓它們的分頁按鈕互指。"

msgid "Total"
msgstr "合計"

msgid "Tracking number, from ECPay, RY Tools, AST or Shipment Tracking"
msgstr "物流單號，來自綠界、RY Tools、AST 或 Shipment Tracking"

msgid "Tracking numbers are read from ECPay, RY Tools, Advanced Shipment Tracking and WooCommerce Shipment Tracking. After the last attempt the notification is sent anyway, without the number."
msgstr "物流單號會從綠界、RY Tools、Advanced Shipment Tracking 和 WooCommerce Shipment Tracking 讀取。試到最後一次仍然沒有的話，通知還是會送出，只是不含單號。"

msgid "Tracking wait"
msgstr "等待設定"

msgid "Transaction"
msgstr "交易編號"

msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "觸發"

msgid "Trigger text"
msgstr "觸發文字"

msgid "Turn them on"
msgstr "開啟通知"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "類型"

msgid "Type SEND in the confirmation box to go ahead."
msgstr "請在確認欄位輸入 SEND 才會送出。"

msgid "Type SEND to confirm"
msgstr "輸入 SEND 以確認"

msgid "Type your message"
msgstr "輸入您的訊息"

msgid "Unlink"
msgstr "解除連結"

msgid "Unlink LINE account"
msgstr "解除 LINE 帳號連結"

msgid "Unlink your LINE account?"
msgstr "要解除 LINE 帳號連結嗎？"

msgid "Up to %d regions. The image must be at least 1040 pixels wide; LINE is served five sizes of it from this site."
msgstr "最多 %d 個範圍。圖片寬度至少要 1040 像素；本站會提供五種尺寸給 LINE 取用。"

msgid "Up to ten cards side by side, each with buttons"
msgstr "最多十張卡片並排，每張都有按鈕"

msgid "Up to ten images side by side, each tappable"
msgstr "最多十張圖片並排，每張都可點擊"

msgid "Use a long-lived token I paste below"
msgstr "使用我在下方貼上的長效 Token"

msgid "Use as the default menu for everyone"
msgstr "設為所有人的預設選單"

msgid "Use the sandbox environment (no real money moves)"
msgstr "使用沙盒環境（不會有實際金流）"

msgid "Used by the LIFF shortcodes unless one is given explicitly."
msgstr "LIFF 短代碼在沒有另外指定時會使用這個。"

msgid "Uses the most recent order to fill in the values. Save first."
msgstr "會用最近一筆訂單的資料填入變數。請先儲存。"

msgid "View"
msgstr "看看"

msgid "View order"
msgstr "查看訂單"

msgid "Visitor"
msgstr "訪客"

msgid "Wait for tracking"
msgstr "等待物流單號"

msgid "Waiting for the customer to complete payment on LINE Pay."
msgstr "等待客人在 LINE Pay 完成付款。"

msgid "Warnings and errors"
msgstr "警告與錯誤"

msgid "Warnings only"
msgstr "只看警告"

msgid "Webhook URL"
msgstr "Webhook URL"

msgid "Webhook has received an event"
msgstr "Webhook 已收到過事件"

msgid "Webhook signatures are verified with this. Without it, nothing the bot receives can be trusted."
msgstr "Webhook 的簽章是用這個驗證的。沒有它，機器人收到的任何東西都不可信。"

msgid "Webhook signing secret is the Messaging API one"
msgstr "Webhook 簽章用的是 Messaging API 的密鑰"

msgid "Webhooks are signed with the Messaging API channel secret. Falling back to the Login channel secret only works when both channels are the same, which is unusual."
msgstr "Webhook 是用 Messaging API 的 Channel Secret 簽章的。退而使用 Login 頻道的密鑰只有在兩個頻道相同時才會成功，而那並不常見。"

msgid "What every recipient gets. A broadcast is billed per person and cannot be recalled, so this is the last look you have."
msgstr "每位收件者會看到的樣子。群發按人數計費且無法收回，這是你最後一次確認的機會。"

msgid "What is this for"
msgstr "這筆款項的名目"

msgid "What name should we put this under?"
msgstr "請問怎麼稱呼？"

msgid "What the bot asks"
msgstr "機器人問什麼"

msgid "What the customer sees at checkout."
msgstr "客人在結帳頁會看到的名稱。"

msgid "When"
msgstr "時間"

msgid "When a message contains this, the bot stops answering and the conversation is flagged for a human."
msgstr "訊息包含這個關鍵字時，機器人就停止回覆，並把對話標記為需要真人處理。"

msgid "When tapped"
msgstr "點擊時"

msgid "When they finish, say"
msgstr "完成後說"

msgid "When to send"
msgstr "什麼時候發送"

msgid "Where to send people after login. Leave blank to return them to the page they came from."
msgstr "登入後要把人導到哪裡。留空就會回到他們原本的頁面。"

msgid "Which area of the plugin"
msgstr "外掛的哪個區塊"

msgid "Which conversations to show"
msgstr "要顯示哪些對話"

msgid "Which date would you like?"
msgstr "想預約哪一天？"

msgid "Which results to show"
msgstr "要顯示哪些結果"

msgid "Which service?"
msgstr "想預約哪個服務？"

msgid "Whichever chatbot you have set up in AI Engine, including its knowledge base."
msgstr "你在 AI Engine 裡設定的聊天機器人，包含它的知識庫。"

msgid "Who"
msgstr "對象"

msgid "Width"
msgstr "寬度"

msgid "With an image or a title, the text is limited to %d characters."
msgstr "有圖片或標題時，文字上限為 %d 字。"

msgid "With immediate capture off, payments are only authorised. You then have to capture or void each one, and an order cancelled in WooCommerce releases its authorisation automatically."
msgstr "關閉立即請款時，付款只會被授權。之後你必須自己請款或作廢，而在 WooCommerce 取消訂單會自動釋放該筆授權。"

msgid "WooCommerce"
msgstr "WooCommerce"

msgid "WooCommerce is not active, so there are no products to build from."
msgstr "WooCommerce 沒有啟用，沒有商品可以建立卡片。"

msgid "WooCommerce is not active, so there is nothing to notify about."
msgstr "WooCommerce 沒有啟用，因此沒有可以通知的內容。"

msgid "WooCommerce is not active."
msgstr "WooCommerce 沒有啟用。"

msgid "WordPress AI (built into WordPress 7.0 and later)"
msgstr "WordPress AI（WordPress 7.0 起內建）"

msgid "WordPress AI Client"
msgstr "WordPress AI Client"

msgid "WordPress AI Client (WordPress %s)"
msgstr "WordPress AI Client（WordPress %s）"

msgid "WordPress account"
msgstr "WordPress 帳號"

msgid "WordPress has the AI Client but no provider is connected, so it cannot answer anything yet. Install the AI plugin from WordPress.org and connect a provider there."
msgstr "WordPress 有 AI Client，但還沒接上任何供應商，所以目前什麼都答不出來。請從 WordPress.org 安裝「AI」外掛，在裡面連接一個供應商。"

msgid "Working..."
msgstr "處理中…"

msgid "Write a message or choose a template first."
msgstr "請先輸入訊息內容或選擇一個範本。"

msgid "Write a reply"
msgstr "輸入回覆內容"

msgid "Write something first."
msgstr "請先輸入內容。"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "好"

msgid "You are a customer service assistant for %s, replying inside LINE."
msgstr "你是 %s 的客服助理，正在 LINE 裡回覆客人。"

msgid "You are not signed in."
msgstr "你尚未登入。"

msgid "You can use {display_name}, {site_name} and {site_url}."
msgstr "可以使用 {display_name}、{site_name} 和 {site_url}。"

msgid "You cannot change conversations."
msgstr "你沒有權限變更對話。"

msgid "You cannot clear the log."
msgstr "你沒有權限清除紀錄。"

msgid "You cannot create payment links."
msgstr "你沒有權限建立收款連結。"

msgid "You cannot read conversations."
msgstr "你沒有權限檢視對話。"

msgid "You cannot reply to conversations."
msgstr "你沒有權限回覆對話。"

msgid "You cannot resend notifications."
msgstr "你沒有權限重新發送通知。"

msgid "You cannot send broadcasts."
msgstr "你沒有權限群發訊息。"

msgid "You cannot send test notifications."
msgstr "你沒有權限發送測試通知。"

msgid "You cannot unlink another user."
msgstr "你不能解除其他使用者的連結。"

