msgid "This is the default rich menu. Deleting it takes the menu away from every customer at once, until you make another one the default. Delete it anyway?"
msgstr "這是預設的圖文選單。刪掉之後，在你把另一個設為預設之前，所有客人的選單都會立刻消失。仍然要刪除嗎？"

msgid "Rich menu deleted. That was the default, so until you make another menu the default, customers see whatever the LINE Official Account Manager holds -- or no menu at all."
msgstr "圖文選單已刪除。那是預設選單，在你把另一個設為預設之前，客人看到的會是 LINE 官方帳號管理後台上傳的那個——或是完全沒有選單。"

msgid "LINE has no default menu, so everyone falls back to whatever the Official Account Manager holds."
msgstr "LINE 這邊沒有預設選單，所有人都會退回到官方帳號管理後台上傳的那個。"

msgid "Default menu: %s, which matches this site."
msgstr "預設選單：%s，和這個網站記錄的一致。"

msgid "LINE serves %s as the default, which is not what this site has marked. Set the default again here to line them up."
msgstr "LINE 實際發送的預設是 %s，和這個網站標記的不一樣。在這裡重新設定一次預設就會對齊。"

msgid "Check what LINE has"
msgstr "查看 LINE 那邊的設定"

msgid "Point LINE at this site"
msgstr "把 LINE 指向這個網站"

msgid "This channel has no webhook URL set, so nothing anyone sends the bot reaches this site."
msgstr "這個頻道沒有設定 Webhook 網址，所以任何人傳給機器人的訊息都不會進到這個網站。"

msgid "LINE is set to deliver to %s"
msgstr "LINE 目前設定送到 %s"

msgid "That is not this site, which expects %s. Events are going somewhere else."
msgstr "那不是這個網站，這裡預期的是 %s。事件被送到別的地方了。"

msgid "Webhook delivery is switched on."
msgstr "Webhook 傳送已開啟。"

msgid "Webhook delivery is switched OFF in the Console, so LINE holds the URL but sends nothing to it."
msgstr "Console 裡的 Webhook 傳送是關閉的，所以 LINE 記著這個網址，但什麼都不會送過來。"

msgid "LINE delivered a test event and this site answered %d."
msgstr "LINE 送出了一個測試事件，這個網站回應 %d。"

msgid "LINE could not deliver a test event: %1$s (HTTP %2$d)."
msgstr "LINE 無法送出測試事件：%1$s（HTTP %2$d）。"

msgid "The channel is pointed at this site and delivery is on."
msgstr "頻道已指向這個網站，傳送也是開啟的。"

msgid "The channel is not delivering to this site."
msgstr "頻道目前沒有把事件送到這個網站。"

msgid "LINE now delivers to this site. If delivery is still off, turn on \"Use webhook\" in the Console -- that switch has no API."
msgstr "LINE 現在會送到這個網站了。如果傳送仍是關閉的，請到 Console 打開「Use webhook」——那個開關沒有 API 可以控制。"

msgid "You cannot change the webhook settings."
msgstr "你沒有變更 Webhook 設定的權限。"

msgid "Fill in the Messaging API channel first."
msgstr "請先填好 Messaging API 頻道資訊。"

msgid "Paste the webhook URL into the Console, enable \"Use webhook\", then press Verify. \"Check what LINE has\" on the Messaging API tab reports whether that worked."
msgstr "把 Webhook 網址貼到 Console，打開「Use webhook」，然後按 Verify。Messaging API 分頁上的「查看 LINE 那邊的設定」會告訴你到底成功了沒有。"

msgid "LINE has %1$s rich menu and %2$s aliases."
msgid_plural "LINE has %1$s rich menus and %2$s aliases."
msgstr[0] "LINE 上有 %1$s 個圖文選單、%2$s 個別名。"

msgid "This site tracks %s."
msgid_plural "This site tracks %s."
msgstr[0] "這個網站記錄了 %s 個。"

msgid "Only on LINE: %s"
msgstr "只存在於 LINE：%s"

msgid "Comparison complete."
msgstr "比對完成。"

msgid "Only on LINE: %1$s (%2$s)"
msgstr "只存在於 LINE：%1$s（%2$s）"

msgid "%s conversation is being handled by a person right now. None of these rules run for it -- the bot stays quiet so it does not talk over you. Hand it back to the bot in the inbox to test a rule with that account."
msgid_plural "%s conversations are being handled by a person right now. None of these rules run for them -- the bot stays quiet so it does not talk over you. Hand them back to the bot in the inbox to test a rule with those accounts."
msgstr[0] "目前有 %s 個對話由真人接手中。這些規則對它們完全不會執行——機器人會保持安靜，才不會蓋過你說的話。要用那個帳號測試規則，請先在收件匣把它交還給機器人。"

msgid "Open the inbox"
msgstr "開啟收件匣"

msgid "Pick a conversation on the left to read it and reply."
msgstr "在左邊選一則對話，就能閱讀並回覆。"

msgid "Yes, do it"
msgstr "確定執行"

msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "關閉"

msgid "Remove every area from this menu?"
msgstr "要移除這個選單上的所有區塊嗎？"

